desc:GFX G Magician [elemental synth]
//tags: instrument synth additive morph filter arpeggiator modulation matrix reverb distortion performance arcana
//author: JGWizrad / Garden FX (GFX)
//
// Requires gfx-drift, gfx-output, gfx-ui, gfx-panel, gfx-instrument, gfx-arp and gfx-s57 (.jsfx-inc) in the same folder.
//
// THE MAGICIAN (card I of the GFX Arcana series): willpower and manifestation, the mastery of the four elements -
// as above, so below. A performance synth that puts all four elements of synthesis under the hands at once, so any
// sound can be called up straight away. Dressed in the Series 57 colours, an altar of alabaster and charcoal.
//   FIRE   the source. MANIFESTATION morphs without a break from a pure sine, through additive harmonics, into
//          complex, inharmonic partials (bells, bars, gongs) and on into pitched noise and pure noise. PURITY: the
//          partials' slope (steep and pure .. flat and rich). CHAOS: the source drives itself (self-modulation) and
//          overloads - from a shimmer to a snarl.
//   WATER  the flow: a ladder low-pass and a state-variable high-pass under one knob, INTUIT: from dark (the
//          low-pass closing) through open (the middle) to thin (the high-pass opening). The FLOW pad: across,
//          RESONANCE; up, KEY TRACKING. DEPTH drives the ladder.
//   AIR    the breath: no ADSR, two gestures. WILL: the attack's snap - from a slow swell to an instant strike
//          with a transient. SPIRIT: the whole decay / sustain / release curve - from a pluck, through a held organ,
//          to a long pad. VELOCITY: how much the touch matters - a harder touch also snaps quicker and brighter.
//   EARTH  the foundation: the MANIFESTATION MATRIX. Four routings from ORBIT (an LFO), BREATH (the envelope),
//          VELOCITY, the PAD's X or Y, or FATE (slow chance) to any of twelve destinations. To route: press INVOKE,
//          pick a source, touch the knob to be moved (it is assigned), then drag on the PAD to set the depth (up +,
//          down -). INVOKE off: the PAD is a performance controller. GROUNDING scales every routing at once.
//          COSMIC: a wide, shimmering reverb (SIZE, DECAY, SHIMMER - an octave above, fed back - MIX).
//          EARTHLY: a valve-and-fold distortion (DRIVE, TONE, MIX), oversampled 2x.
//   THE INFINITY RING  sixteen steps round the ouroboros: click to cycle a step through ON, ACCENT, TIE and OFF -
//          the arpeggiator follows the rhythm drawn on the ring and transposes it by the keys held. ARP, HOLD, RATE,
//          MODE, OCTAVES, GATE, LENGTH. RUN / FOLLOW: FOLLOW (the default) locks the arp to REAPER's bars while
//          the project plays and runs it from the first key when stopped; RUN always runs it on its own from the
//          first key, at the project tempo, whatever the transport does (it stays across presets).
//   MANIFESTATION MACROS  four strips under the elements: press MAP, then touch a knob - the strip now sweeps
//          that control up from where the knob is (drag along the strip). Several strips at once: sweeping changes.
//   FATE   the series' drift (0 - 100 %, 50 % = the standard amount): every note's tuning, the filter and the source's
//          shape wander a little, never quite the same twice; FATE is also a source in the matrix.
//   VOLUME, SAT (the output soft clip is always on). POLY / MONO / LEGATO and GLIDE.
// MIDI: notes, pitch bend (+/- 2), CC1 (the PAD's Y), CC64 sustain, CC120 / CC123 all notes off.

import gfx-drift.jsfx-inc
import gfx-output.jsfx-inc
import gfx-ui.jsfx-inc
import gfx-panel.jsfx-inc
import gfx-instrument.jsfx-inc
import gfx-arp.jsfx-inc
import gfx-s57.jsfx-inc

slider1:20<0,100,0.1>-Manifestation (%)
slider2:60<0,100,0.1>-Purity (%)
slider3:8<0,100,0.1>-Chaos (%)
slider4:0<-2,2,1>-Octave
slider5:0<-12,12,0.01>-Tune (st)
slider6:38<0,100,0.1>-Intuition (dark .. open .. thin, %)
slider7:25<0,100,0.1>-Resonance (%)
slider8:50<0,100,0.1>-Key tracking (%)
slider9:20<0,100,0.1>-Depth (%)
slider10:75<0,100,0.1>-Willpower (%)
slider11:45<0,100,0.1>-Spirit (%)
slider12:60<0,100,1>-Velocity (%)
slider13:100<0,100,1>-Grounding (%)
slider14:50<0,100,0.1>-Pad X (%)
slider15:50<0,100,0.1>-Pad Y (%)
slider16:1<0,6,1{Off,Orbit,Breath,Velocity,Pad X,Pad Y,Fate}>-Route 1 source
slider17:5<0,12,1{None,Manifest,Purity,Chaos,Pitch,Intuition,Resonance,Depth,Willpower,Spirit,Cosmos,Earth,Volume}>-Route 1 destination
slider18:12<-100,100,1>-Route 1 depth (%)
slider19:2<0,6,1{Off,Orbit,Breath,Velocity,Pad X,Pad Y,Fate}>-Route 2 source
slider20:5<0,12,1{None,Manifest,Purity,Chaos,Pitch,Intuition,Resonance,Depth,Willpower,Spirit,Cosmos,Earth,Volume}>-Route 2 destination
slider21:20<-100,100,1>-Route 2 depth (%)
slider22:0<0,6,1{Off,Orbit,Breath,Velocity,Pad X,Pad Y,Fate}>-Route 3 source
slider23:0<0,12,1{None,Manifest,Purity,Chaos,Pitch,Intuition,Resonance,Depth,Willpower,Spirit,Cosmos,Earth,Volume}>-Route 3 destination
slider24:0<-100,100,1>-Route 3 depth (%)
slider25:0<0,6,1{Off,Orbit,Breath,Velocity,Pad X,Pad Y,Fate}>-Route 4 source
slider26:0<0,12,1{None,Manifest,Purity,Chaos,Pitch,Intuition,Resonance,Depth,Willpower,Spirit,Cosmos,Earth,Volume}>-Route 4 destination
slider27:0<-100,100,1>-Route 4 depth (%)
slider28:0.4<0.05,20,0.001>-Orbit rate (Hz)
slider29:0<0,4,1{Sine,Triangle,Saw,Square,Random}>-Orbit shape
slider30:0<0,100,0.1>-Macro 1 (%)
slider31:0<0,100,0.1>-Macro 2 (%)
slider32:0<0,100,0.1>-Macro 3 (%)
slider33:0<0,100,0.1>-Macro 4 (%)
slider34:1<0,12,1{None,Manifest,Purity,Chaos,Pitch,Intuition,Resonance,Depth,Willpower,Spirit,Cosmos,Earth,Volume}>-Macro 1 destination
slider35:5<0,12,1{None,Manifest,Purity,Chaos,Pitch,Intuition,Resonance,Depth,Willpower,Spirit,Cosmos,Earth,Volume}>-Macro 2 destination
slider36:10<0,12,1{None,Manifest,Purity,Chaos,Pitch,Intuition,Resonance,Depth,Willpower,Spirit,Cosmos,Earth,Volume}>-Macro 3 destination
slider37:11<0,12,1{None,Manifest,Purity,Chaos,Pitch,Intuition,Resonance,Depth,Willpower,Spirit,Cosmos,Earth,Volume}>-Macro 4 destination
slider38:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Arpeggiator
slider39:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Arp hold
slider40:3<0,5,1{1/4,1/8,1/8T,1/16,1/16T,1/32}>-Arp rate
slider41:0<0,6,1{Up,Down,Up-Down,Down-Up,As played,Random,Chord}>-Arp mode
slider42:2<1,4,1>-Arp octaves
slider43:60<10,100,1>-Arp gate (%)
slider44:1<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 1
slider45:0<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 2
slider46:1<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 3
slider47:1<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 4
slider48:2<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 5
slider49:0<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 6
slider50:1<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 7
slider51:0<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 8
slider52:1<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 9
slider53:1<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 10
slider54:0<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 11
slider55:1<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 12
slider56:2<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 13
slider57:0<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 14
slider58:1<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 15
slider59:3<0,3,1{Off,On,Accent,Tie}>-Ring 16
